---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Pricing — TotalRecalls" description="One-time $24 launch price. No subscription. 14-day refund.">

  <h1>Pricing</h1>
  <p>TotalRecalls is a small Windows app that saves your ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini, and Grok conversations into a private folder on your computer — readable Markdown + JSON you keep forever.</p>
  <p>No subscription. No cloud locker. No account required.</p>

  <section class="price-card">
    <h2>Launch Price</h2>
    <div class="price-block">
      <span class="price-current" data-tr-price>$24</span>
      <span class="price-badge">launch price</span>
    </div>
    <p class="price-note">One-time purchase · Windows app · Local files only</p>
    <p>Pay once with Lemon Squeezy. You'll receive a download link for the Windows app immediately after purchase.</p>
    <a href="" data-tr-buy class="buy-button buy-lg">Buy TotalRecalls — <span data-tr-price>$24</span></a>
    <p class="guarantee-note">14-day money-back guarantee. If TotalRecalls doesn't work for you, email us and we'll refund it — no questions asked.</p>
    <p class="early-access-note">Early access build. Actively improving based on user feedback.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>What You Get</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Export from ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini (Takeout), Grok</li>
      <li>Local Markdown + JSON files</li>
      <li>Private folder structure you own</li>
      <li>No cloud storage</li>
      <li>No telemetry</li>
      <li>No recurring fees</li>
      <li>Free minor updates during the launch period</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Why $24?</h2>
    <p>Launch price. Goes to $49 when the launch window closes.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Refund Policy</h2>
    <p>14-day money-back guarantee. If the app doesn't work for you, email <a href="mailto:support@totalrecalls.app">support@totalrecalls.app</a> within 14 days of purchase for a full refund.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Why One-Time Pricing?</h2>
    <p>TotalRecalls is a utility, not a subscription service. You pay once, download the app, and keep your archive forever.</p>
    <p>Later, when advanced features arrive (semantic search, Obsidian/Notion sync, RAG containers, multi-device memory), those will be <strong>optional upgrades</strong> — not required for basic exporting.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="footer-cta" style="background: var(--color-midnight); color: var(--color-surface); text-align: center;">
    <h2 style="color: var(--color-surface);">Ready to own your AI conversations?</h2>
    <div class="price-block" style="justify-content: center;">
      <span class="price-current" data-tr-price>$24</span>
      <span class="price-badge">launch price</span>
    </div>
    <a href="" data-tr-buy class="buy-button buy-lg">Buy TotalRecalls — <span data-tr-price>$24</span></a>
    <p class="guarantee-note" style="color: var(--color-surface); opacity: 0.85;">14-day money-back guarantee. If TotalRecalls doesn't work for you, email us and we'll refund it — no questions asked.</p>
    <p><a href="/download/" style="color: var(--color-surface);">Already purchased? Download ZIP</a></p>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
